NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000153 "=head1 CONTRIBUTING"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000154 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000155 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000156 "To contribute, you can send patches by email/via RT, or send pull requests on"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000157 "GitHub."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000158 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000159 "Most of the time, you don't need to build the distribution yourself. You can"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000160 "simply modify the code, then test via:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000161 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000162 " % prove -l"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000163 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000164 "If you want to build the distribution (e.g. to try to install it locally on your"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000165 "system), you can install L<Dist::Zilla>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000166 "L<Dist::Zilla::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000167 "L<Pod::Weaver::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>, and sometimes one or two other"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000168 "Dist::Zilla- and/or Pod::Weaver plugins. Any additional steps required beyond"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000169 "that are considered a bug and can be reported to me."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000170 ""
